Package: xv
Architecture: any
Depends:
    ${shlibs:Depends},
    ${misc:Depends}
Description: Classic X11 image viewer (jasper-software v6.0.4)
 XV is a classic interactive image manipulation program for the X Window System.
 It can display and edit images in many formats including GIF, JPEG, TIFF, PNG,
 BMP, XPM, and more.
 .
 This package is based on the actively-maintained jasper-software/xv fork which
 includes modern library support, bug fixes, and HiDPI improvements.
